WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
This show contains scenes that some viewers may find disturbing.​ Viewer discretion ​is ​advised.

00:00:03.640 --> 00:00:07.980
<i>They say the children were 
the first to notice.</i>

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:11.610
Hey, wait, Nico... I said to wait!

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:14.490
If you get lost, I'm the one 
who'll get in trouble!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:18.700
How many times have you been told 
not to wander in the forest?

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:21.080
If you're eaten by wolves, don't blame me!

00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:23.830
Not to mention, the Kushans recently...

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:24.500
Fairy.

00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:27.460
Toma, I saw a fairy.

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.210
What are you talking about?

00:00:29.210 --> 00:00:32.420
This is why I didn't want to 
bring you along, shrimp!

00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:33.510
Don't, Toma.

00:00:34.010 --> 00:00:38.680
But I sort of understand why 
Nico might feel that way.

00:00:38.680 --> 00:00:41.390
I can't really explain... But lately, 
haven't you felt a bit weird?

00:00:41.390 --> 00:00:42.810
Huh? You, too?

00:00:42.810 --> 00:00:44.600
Yeah, I've felt strange, too.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.020
What are you talking about?

00:00:46.270 --> 00:00:49.860
We've been coming to this forest forever.

00:00:49.860 --> 00:00:51.940
But has it always been like this?

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:53.280
What do you mean?

00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.200
It almost feels like we're in the forest,

00:00:56.200 --> 00:00:58.700
but it's in our dreams...

00:01:00.080 --> 00:01:01.910
Did you hear something?

00:01:02.450 --> 00:01:03.660
Like someone laughing?

00:01:11.380 --> 00:01:12.670
It stopped...

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:14.840
What now?!

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.300
Toma, look.

00:01:19.300 --> 00:01:20.930
A forest demon!

00:01:21.180 --> 00:01:22.430
Monster.

00:01:23.520 --> 00:01:24.850
<i>Secretly...</i>

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:28.520
<i>The hollows of trees,
the ground beneath graves,</i>

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:30.270
<i>between the waves,</i>

00:01:30.270 --> 00:01:32.480
<i>the whispers of the wind,</i>

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.320
<i>the bottom of wells,</i>

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:36.610
<i>the darkness of attics...</i>

00:01:37.150 --> 00:01:38.240
<i>Secretly,</i>

00:01:38.780 --> 00:01:40.780
<i>imperceptibly,</i>

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:45.580
<i>the silence was no longer silent.</i>

00:01:46.620 --> 00:01:50.460
<i>Just as in tales told by 
the old to the young,</i>

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:54.460
<i>as though it had always been there,</i>

00:01:54.960 --> 00:02:00.590
<i>something indeed dwelt 
within the silence.</i>

00:02:00.590 --> 00:02:04.100
<b><i>The Rent World</i></b>

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.940
Good morning, Dad.

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:53.250
We're back.

00:03:53.250 --> 00:03:53.960
Heya.

00:03:55.080 --> 00:03:58.090
Guts... Casca...

00:04:04.340 --> 00:04:05.390
I guess...

00:04:06.470 --> 00:04:07.720
We were a little late.

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:11.770
It happened right after you left, Guts.

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:12.850
Sorry.

00:04:12.850 --> 00:04:15.730
No, even Dad said

00:04:15.730 --> 00:04:19.480
that simply being able to see you 
before he died was enough.

00:04:19.480 --> 00:04:23.150
And he didn't want you 
to see him after he'd died.

00:04:23.150 --> 00:04:27.030
But thank goodness! I'm so 
happy you found Casca!

00:04:27.030 --> 00:04:31.250
If she hadn't been found, it would 
have been all my fault.

00:04:31.250 --> 00:04:34.420
Hey, so what are you going 
to do now, Guts?

00:04:34.420 --> 00:04:37.500
You aren't leaving Casca 
behind again, are you?

00:04:38.090 --> 00:04:40.960
Let's all live here together.

00:04:44.380 --> 00:04:50.470
I'm sure if you stay and are nice to 
her, Casca won't run off again!

00:04:52.060 --> 00:04:53.140
Yeah.

00:04:55.230 --> 00:04:57.230
Really? You really mean it?

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:58.440
It's a promise!

00:04:58.440 --> 00:04:59.060
Yeah.

00:04:58.730 --> 00:05:00.230
Yay!

00:05:00.480 --> 00:05:02.230
Are you sure?

00:05:00.730 --> 00:05:04.990
Yay! Yay! Yay, yay, yay!

00:05:02.230 --> 00:05:04.990
That was a pretty empty promise.

00:05:06.490 --> 00:05:07.660
Yay!

00:05:07.660 --> 00:05:09.700
<i>It's a half-assed promise.</i>

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.410
Yay! Yay!

00:05:10.530 --> 00:05:12.490
<i>As soon as we got Casca back...</i>

00:05:12.490 --> 00:05:13.120
<i>No.</i>

00:05:13.830 --> 00:05:16.830
<i>Even when I was swinging my 
sword to get her back,</i>

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:19.670
<i>I...</i>

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:23.630
<i>When he appeared before me,</i>

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.260
<i>he wasn't in demon form, but human.</i>

00:05:27.300 --> 00:05:30.640
<i>As if he'd shown up just 
as he'd been back then.</i>

00:05:31.600 --> 00:05:35.680
<i>The moment I saw him, 
I forgot all my malice.</i>

00:05:36.850 --> 00:05:38.560
<i>And that is unforgivable!</i>

00:05:40.520 --> 00:05:42.230
<i>It was an aimless journey.</i>

00:05:43.190 --> 00:05:45.530
<i>All I had were strange rumors</i>

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:48.160
<i>and the faint presence 
I felt from the brand.</i>

00:05:48.530 --> 00:05:50.320
<i>I had no idea where he was...</i>

00:05:50.320 --> 00:05:53.990
<i>No... I searched for his 
shadow, not in this world,</i>

00:05:53.990 --> 00:05:56.370
<i>pushing through souls of the dead.</i>

00:05:56.790 --> 00:06:00.540
<i>But now, he's in the same world as I am.</i>

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.380
<i>Treading the same ground I do.</i>

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:06.050
<i>Within the reach of my sword!</i>

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:13.260
I just remembered we 
have a guest right now.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.310
A guest?

00:06:14.310 --> 00:06:18.770
Yeah, he's apparently an old 
acquaintance of Rickert's.

00:06:19.650 --> 00:06:22.770
He said he was a friend from 
when Rickert was a soldier,

00:06:22.770 --> 00:06:25.070
so maybe you know him, too.

00:06:26.610 --> 00:06:28.490
He has long, silver hair.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:32.910
And he's so pretty, I could 
hardly believe he's a man!

00:06:33.830 --> 00:06:37.830
He looks like he stepped 
out of a fairy tale.

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:45.630
I still can't believe it.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:50.510
That day, no one other than 
Guts and Casca came back.

00:06:50.880 --> 00:06:52.850
Judeau, Corkus, Pippin...

00:06:53.350 --> 00:06:54.640
No one...

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:58.730
I don't know what happened that day.

00:06:59.560 --> 00:07:01.400
Guts won't tell me.

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:05.940
I thought everything had ended...

00:07:06.480 --> 00:07:08.940
But to think we'd meet again!

00:07:14.700 --> 00:07:15.740
Guts!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:27.420
Guts?

00:07:28.050 --> 00:07:29.050
Wait a minute!

00:07:30.130 --> 00:07:31.680
Out of the way, Rickert!

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:34.760
No! How could you suddenly 
attack him like that?

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:39.220
He's Griffith... He's our Griffith!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:40.930
How could you?

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:46.440
He's not the Griffith you knew anymore!

00:07:48.150 --> 00:07:49.900
What are you talking about?

00:07:49.900 --> 00:07:51.450
Just get out of the way!

00:07:51.450 --> 00:07:53.660
No! What's going on?!

00:07:54.530 --> 00:07:56.160
I see you haven't changed.

00:07:56.580 --> 00:07:59.330
Your sword still moves before your mouth.

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:00.750
No, actually...

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.120
<i>Don't talk about me...</i>

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:06.540
It is exactly as it was when we met.

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:10.670
<i>With the same face, the same 
laugh, the same voice!</i>

00:08:10.670 --> 00:08:14.680
You bastard... Why the hell 
did you come here?

00:08:15.340 --> 00:08:16.640
To see you.

00:08:18.470 --> 00:08:21.430
Back at that tower, it was rather chaotic.

00:08:21.930 --> 00:08:25.230
So I had no chance to speak to you alone.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:27.900
I thought this place more fitting,

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:31.440
since we Band of the Hawk have reunited.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:35.160
Don't you dare say that name!

00:08:36.780 --> 00:08:38.490
I came to learn...

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:42.200
If I stood before you, in my new body,

00:08:42.620 --> 00:08:45.460
whether my heart would be moved.

00:08:48.210 --> 00:08:52.210
It appears that I... am free.

00:08:54.880 --> 00:08:56.180
Nothing...

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:57.720
For what you did...

00:08:57.720 --> 00:09:00.220
For all those you betrayed...

00:09:00.220 --> 00:09:03.980
You're saying you feel nothing at all?!

00:09:04.270 --> 00:09:06.600
I shan't betray my dream.

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:08.440
That is all.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:19.370
It's been a while, Black Swordsman.

00:09:19.990 --> 00:09:21.120
Zodd!

00:09:29.290 --> 00:09:31.130
What's the matter, Casca?

00:09:31.380 --> 00:09:32.800
This presence!

00:09:40.550 --> 00:09:43.430
<i>He managed to stop a swing from 
that giant blade Guts has?</i>

00:09:44.480 --> 00:09:46.230
<i>Who is that man?</i>

00:09:50.980 --> 00:09:54.940
Well done in surviving, 
despite my prediction.

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:56.900
This makes me happy, boy!

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:18.970
Very good.

00:10:19.260 --> 00:10:22.180
As a human, you've done 
well to gain such a form.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:26.140
I wanted to face you again like this,

00:10:26.140 --> 00:10:28.810
once you'd lived through that carnage.

00:10:28.810 --> 00:10:30.650
What's going on?

00:10:30.650 --> 00:10:32.770
Why are you with Griffith?

00:10:33.480 --> 00:10:35.230
Get out of my way!

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:37.990
I have business with Griffith.

00:10:37.990 --> 00:10:41.570
Words are meaningless. 
Force your way through.

00:10:47.000 --> 00:10:48.330
<i>Such strength with his sword.</i>

00:10:48.330 --> 00:10:50.580
<i>If I stay on defense, he'll crush me.</i>

00:10:58.970 --> 00:11:01.760
<i>If I blink, my head will be split open.</i>

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.640
<i>Matching his blows is rattling my bones.</i>

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.310
<i>I can't just absorb this force!</i>

00:11:08.350 --> 00:11:09.690
<i>But I can fight.</i>

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:14.480
<i>The countless nights trying to reach 
him have built me up to this point!</i>

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.730
<i>You're just in the way!</i>

00:11:17.030 --> 00:11:18.650
<i>It's so intense...</i>

00:11:18.650 --> 00:11:22.240
<i>I've never seen a fight like this, 
not even on the battlefield.</i>

00:11:22.660 --> 00:11:25.780
<i>Guts has grown stronger. So much 
that I can't even imagine.</i>

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:28.910
<i>He's handling that giant 
blade like it's nothing.</i>

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:33.710
<i>But that rage... That fury is 
directed toward Griffith?</i>

00:11:34.380 --> 00:11:35.340
<i>But why?</i>

00:11:38.210 --> 00:11:39.130
My...

00:11:45.140 --> 00:11:46.010
Not good!

00:11:56.270 --> 00:11:58.230
<i>This battle is unbelievable.</i>

00:11:58.440 --> 00:12:00.280
<i>That man is amazing, too.</i>

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:02.360
<i>But Guts makes decisions in a second.</i>

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:07.910
<i>Life or death battles... Guts has 
survived them countless times.</i>

00:12:13.040 --> 00:12:15.290
<i>My blood should have frozen over.</i>

00:12:17.000 --> 00:12:20.670
<i>Are these feelings from the infant</i>

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.930
<i>that fused into my vessel?</i>

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:32.430
Well done.

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:35.020
Even as a human, you survived the eclipse.

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:38.190
That strength saw you through 
fights with apostles.

00:12:40.990 --> 00:12:44.660
It seems this horse-slaying sword 
I stole from the Kushans

00:12:44.660 --> 00:12:48.700
really is no match for your 
demon-slaying sword.

00:12:49.280 --> 00:12:52.620
A splendid blade and splendid technique.

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:54.080
<i>I'm just getting started!</i>

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:58.250
I haven't had enough yet.

00:13:02.460 --> 00:13:05.220
I haven't devoured enough!

00:13:06.390 --> 00:13:07.430
<i>Zodd?</i>

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:09.930
<i>There's no doubt about it.</i>

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:12.310
<i>That... That man...</i>

00:13:13.180 --> 00:13:15.480
<i>He's Nosferatu Zodd.</i>

00:13:18.230 --> 00:13:19.980
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:49.890
Guts!

00:13:55.020 --> 00:13:56.140
That's...

00:13:56.140 --> 00:13:57.900
Master Godo's mine!

00:14:02.480 --> 00:14:04.650
Hey, Casca...

00:14:04.650 --> 00:14:07.150
Jeez, walking off on your own again!

00:14:10.620 --> 00:14:11.990
You idiot! Stay away!

00:14:12.370 --> 00:14:15.500
Guts? There was a really loud noise.

00:14:39.270 --> 00:14:40.690
A monster!

00:14:44.270 --> 00:14:44.900
Casca!

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:51.240
Cas—

00:14:53.030 --> 00:14:54.700
Casca!

00:15:20.640 --> 00:15:22.310
<i>Stop...</i>

00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:33.820
Enough.

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:35.660
Let's go.

00:15:46.500 --> 00:15:48.210
Wait! Where are you—

00:15:48.210 --> 00:15:51.970
I told you. I shall claim my kingdom.

00:15:53.050 --> 00:15:54.760
Nothing has changed.

00:16:02.980 --> 00:16:04.020
Rickert...

00:16:05.730 --> 00:16:07.520
Nothing has ended.

00:16:08.440 --> 00:16:11.570
After learning the truth, 
if you loathe me, so be it.

00:16:11.570 --> 00:16:14.410
But even still,

00:16:14.410 --> 00:16:18.910
if you wish to pursue our dream, 
I have no reason to refuse.

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:24.120
Wait... I don't understand!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.830
What's the truth?!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.300
Guts, no!

00:16:35.300 --> 00:16:37.100
Move, Rickert!

00:16:37.100 --> 00:16:39.100
Nothing has changed?

00:16:39.100 --> 00:16:41.100
You did all that...

00:16:41.100 --> 00:16:43.600
And nothing has changed?!

00:16:44.350 --> 00:16:46.560
You should have known

00:16:46.560 --> 00:16:48.610
that I was this kind of man.

00:16:49.650 --> 00:16:50.860
You of all people.

00:16:57.620 --> 00:17:00.490
Guts... Tell me.

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:04.000
On that day, what happened 
to Griffith and the others?

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.460
I have a right to know, don't I?!

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:10.550
No, I need to know...

00:17:10.550 --> 00:17:11.670
Guts!

00:17:22.730 --> 00:17:25.310
Is that true?

00:17:27.520 --> 00:17:31.070
How is... How is something like that...

00:17:31.070 --> 00:17:33.860
<i>I had an idea, but...</i>

00:17:34.320 --> 00:17:37.410
<i>I see. That image was from that time.</i>

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:46.710
Aw, it all caved in.

00:17:47.210 --> 00:17:48.380
What now?

00:17:48.380 --> 00:17:51.250
Just when we were together, 
Guts and Casca's home...

00:17:51.250 --> 00:17:52.340
I'll go with you.

00:17:53.800 --> 00:17:56.130
You've been carrying 
all that weight alone.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:18:00.850
While I just stayed here, clueless...

00:18:01.470 --> 00:18:02.850
Take me with you!

00:18:02.850 --> 00:18:03.890
I'm a part of the Band of the—

00:18:03.890 --> 00:18:04.930
No.

00:18:04.930 --> 00:18:06.230
Why not?!

00:18:06.890 --> 00:18:09.190
You don't loathe Griffith.

00:18:10.360 --> 00:18:11.820
You're leaving?!

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:14.230
Everyone...

00:18:14.690 --> 00:18:16.320
Everyone's leaving?

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:18.740
Erica!

00:18:19.240 --> 00:18:20.990
Hurry and go after her.

00:18:29.420 --> 00:18:31.750
So, what are we going to do?

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:33.500
Continue on

00:18:33.500 --> 00:18:35.260
this journey of revenge?

00:18:35.260 --> 00:18:37.800
I won't leave Casca behind again.

00:18:37.800 --> 00:18:39.930
You're taking Casca with you?

00:18:39.930 --> 00:18:40.760
I know.

00:18:41.390 --> 00:18:42.760
I know that it's impossible...

00:18:43.260 --> 00:18:46.810
But the elven mine is destroyed.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:50.310
So isn't staying here more impossible?

00:18:50.310 --> 00:18:54.570
If two branded people stay 
in one place for too long,

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:58.150
we know bad things will happen, 
given the Tower of Conviction.

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:01.450
Aren't there other nearby 
places where elves live?

00:19:01.450 --> 00:19:05.370
Maybe so, but will you keep 
Casca locked up until then?

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.450
That isn't very nice.

00:19:06.450 --> 00:19:09.210
She ran away because she didn't 
want that, didn't she?

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:13.340
I'll just have to search my 
elven pearls of wisdom.

00:19:15.170 --> 00:19:16.670
Oh, I know!

00:19:17.460 --> 00:19:20.300
It's a bit far, but it's a beautiful paradise.

00:19:20.300 --> 00:19:22.010
Probably the safest place in the world!

00:19:22.010 --> 00:19:23.680
Where's that?

00:19:23.680 --> 00:19:25.430
My home.

00:19:41.700 --> 00:19:42.870
Stop...

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:44.200
Help!

00:19:50.120 --> 00:19:52.500
What's going to happen to us?

00:19:52.500 --> 00:19:54.170
I heard a rumor that

00:19:54.170 --> 00:19:57.210
Kushans offer women as 
sacrifices to their god.

00:19:57.670 --> 00:19:58.880
No, that's...

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:01.760
No matter how you see it, 
the kingdom is finished.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:04.890
The Band of the Hawk... If only 
that man were here...

00:20:04.890 --> 00:20:07.350
It's a bit late for that now.

00:20:07.810 --> 00:20:08.850
He's coming.

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:09.730
Huh?

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:11.690
Someone will save us soon.

00:20:11.690 --> 00:20:12.770
What are you talking about?

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:16.610
After seeing her parents burned alive, 
I wonder if she's lost her mind.

00:20:17.940 --> 00:20:18.940
He's coming.

00:20:18.940 --> 00:20:21.240
The Hawk of Light is coming.

00:20:21.950 --> 00:20:24.030
That's what the wind is whispering.

00:20:25.240 --> 00:20:29.910
To think your clan was unable 
to capture a single man.

00:20:29.910 --> 00:20:32.790
How pathetic the Bakiraka are.

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:37.500
And you have the nerve to say he got 
on a demon and disappeared.

00:20:37.500 --> 00:20:38.750
If I may have a word.

00:20:38.750 --> 00:20:43.630
I heard that this invasion began because 
the oracle received a prophecy.

00:20:43.630 --> 00:20:47.260
So this paranormal phenomenon 
shouldn't be strange—

00:20:48.390 --> 00:20:52.430
You are as slaves, from traitorous groups,

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:54.440
that think yourselves soldiers!

00:20:55.020 --> 00:20:59.020
I'm sure the Emperor promoted 
such as you to soldiers in jest.

00:20:59.020 --> 00:21:05.030
To think he'd give you a mission 
on a whim, as well...

00:21:06.280 --> 00:21:08.030
Wh-Wh-What are you doing—

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:12.160
I have a more pressing matter, 
so if you'll excuse me.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:14.500
We failed.

00:21:14.500 --> 00:21:15.120
Run—

00:21:18.090 --> 00:21:19.550
Damn it!

00:21:26.720 --> 00:21:28.600
Please pardon me.

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:32.140
<i>Such skill... Are they monsters?</i>

00:21:32.680 --> 00:21:36.270
We will now continue our 
search for the hawk.

00:21:51.540 --> 00:21:52.450
<i>That's...</i>

00:23:25.590 --> 00:23:27.210
Take care!

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:30.720
Make sure you protect her, Guts!

00:23:31.890 --> 00:23:36.310
<i>When I fled the Band of the Hawk, 
it was also in snow like this.</i>

00:23:37.730 --> 00:23:40.690
<i>This time, I guess I was 
the one left behind.</i>

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:46.190
<i>I won't leave you again...</i>

00:23:49.190 --> 00:23:50.860
<i>I won't lose you this time.</i>

00:23:57.020 --> 00:24:00.900
<b><i>Next Episode Preview</i></b>

00:24:03.000 --> 00:24:05.000
<b>And I have no plans to return 
to that mansion.</b>

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.050
<b>A strange rabbit...</b>

00:24:11.180 --> 00:24:13.340
<b>I am your master... Only I.</b>

00:24:15.430 --> 00:24:17.510
<b>Mother...</b>

00:24:19.560 --> 00:24:21.520
<b>Outside... I cannot survive 
outside of this place.</b>

00:24:23.960 --> 00:24:28.340
<b><i>Next Episode 
Winter Journey</i></b>

00:24:28.340 --> 00:24:30.340
<b><i></i></b>
